#. どうだ！　これが今回の<CLT 3>事件の全貌<CLT>だ！
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's the <CLT 3>whole story behind this incident<CLT>! Well?\n"
"What do you have to say to that!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………………………
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "... ... ..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………………………………………
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "... ... ... ... ..."
msgstr ""

#. …どうした、お得意の壊れたフリか？
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What, are you broken again?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0006 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 逃げようったって…そうはいかないよ…！
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You can't get out of this, so don't even try!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0008 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. オラオラ！　そろそろ正体を現せって！
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Come on! It's time you finally revealed yourself!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0010 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 絶滅危惧種じゃあるまいし…
#. い、いつまで隠れてる気…！？
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It's not like y-you're an endangered species or\n"
"something! How l-long do you plan to keep hiding?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0012 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 諦めなさい、江ノ島盾子。
#. もう終わりよ。
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Give it up, Junko. The game's over."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0014 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ……終わり？
msgctxt "0015 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "...Over?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷ…うぷぷ……
msgctxt "0016 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhu... Puhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. クライマックスで終了…
#. そんな風に思っちゃった…？
msgctxt "0017 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Did you really think the story would end once we\n"
"reached the climax of the case?"
msgstr ""

#. 違うよー！　まだ続くんだよー！
msgctxt "0018 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Wrong! There's still plenty more to go!"
msgstr ""

#. 待っていたわ！　私様は待っていたのよ！
#. あなた達のような人間が現れる事をね！
msgctxt "0019 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"We have been waiting! Waiting so very long for\n"
"peasants like you to appear!"
msgstr ""

#. 私様の配下になるなら、
#. 世界の半分をあなた達に差しあげましょう。
msgctxt "0020 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If you swear your fealty to us, we will reward you\n"
"with half of the entire world!"
msgstr ""

#. すでに、不動産権利書も用意してるわよ！
#. 地位と名誉と私様の手料理も付けてあげるわ！
msgctxt "0021 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"We've even drawn up the deed already! We will grant\n"
"you honor, status, and some of our home cooking!"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0022 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Okay"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0023 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr ""

#. どうする？　私様の配下になる？
msgctxt "0024 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Have you made your choice? Will you serve under us?"
msgstr ""

#. あー、本気で答えちゃった？
#. ごめんごめん、今のはジョークなんだよ。
msgctxt "0025 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Oh, did you think I was being serious? Sorry, I was\n"
"just messing with you."
msgstr ""

#. なんだか久しぶりの人前だからさ、
#. どういうキャラだったか自分でも忘れちゃって…
msgctxt "0026 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It's been so long since I've had an audience, even I'm\n"
"not sure what kind of role I'm supposed to play."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こいつ…こいつが黒幕…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This...is the mastermind?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こいつが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She's...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本物の…江ノ島盾子…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The real Junko Enoshima...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても、やっと解放されたよ…
msgctxt "0030 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Anyway, looks like I've finally been set free."
msgstr ""

#. 毎日毎日、来る日も来る日も、
#. モノクマを演じ続けるなんて…
msgctxt "0031 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Having to play Monokuma all the time, day after day..."
msgstr ""

#. 絶望的に飽きっぽいアタシにとっては、
#. 苦行を通り越して、自殺行為だからさ。
msgctxt "0032 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It was like I was stuck in purgatory, or like a slow\n"
"suicide. I get bored so easy, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな事より…あんたの顔って…
msgctxt "0033 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Y-Your face..."
msgstr ""

#. ん？　アタシの顔がどうかした？
msgctxt "0034 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Huh? What about my face?"
msgstr ""

#. チワワ１００頭分とも称される、
#. この愛くるしい顔がどうかしたのかい？
msgctxt "0035 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"What's wrong with my beautiful face? People have told\n"
"me I'm cuter than a hundred chihuahuas combined."
msgstr ""

#. なんか…<CLT 3>見覚え<CLT>があるよ…？
#. 初めて見る顔じゃないかも…
msgctxt "0036 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I feel like...<CLT 3>this isn't the first time I've seen\n"
"you<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 入学前の事前準備
msgctxt "0037 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Before arriving at school"
msgstr ""

#. 初日の玄関ホール
msgctxt "0038 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The first day, in the main hall"
msgstr ""

#. そうだっけ…？
msgctxt "0039 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Are you sure...?"
msgstr ""

#. その時って、江ノ島盾子は
#. もう戦刃むくろに入れ替わってたんでしょ？
msgctxt "0040 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But Junko had already switched with Mukuro by then,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. 私は、その時じゃない気がするんだけど…
msgctxt "0041 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I don't think that's it..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん…
#. もしかして、もっと前かも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh yeah... Maybe it was before that.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 学園長室
msgctxt "0044 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "In the headmaster's room"
msgstr ""

#. あそこでは、彼女の顔など見なかったわ。
#. 断言してもいいわよ。
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"None of us saw her there. You can say that with\n"
"confidence."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが言うなら間違いないか…
#. それに、そんなに最近の事じゃない気がする…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If Kyoko's that sure, she must be right. I feel like\n"
"it wasn't that recent, anyway...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. …ん？
msgctxt "0048 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "...Hmm?"
msgstr "...Hửm?"

#. 見とれ過ぎて、
#. 何も言えなくなったかい？
msgctxt "0049 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Did you get lost in my eyes? Is that why you're\n"
"speechless?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この顔…
#. やっぱりあれは盛ってなんかいなかったんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So her face wasn't photoshopped after all...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>そう言えば…確かに見覚えがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, I do remember seeing it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクも、あの顔をどこかで見たはずだ。
#. あれは…きっと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure I've seen her too somewhere. Was it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクも、あの顔をどこかで見たはずだ。
#. 確か…この学園に来る前に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure I've seen her too somewhere. It was\n"
"definitely before I got to this school...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
